  "title": "Sort Transformed Array",
  "summary": "Given a sorted integer array nums and integers a, b, c, transform each element nums[i] using the quadratic function f(x) = ax^2 + bx + c, then return the transformed array in sorted order.",
  "statement": "Given a sorted integer array nums and integers a, b, c, transform each element nums[i] using the quadratic function f(x) = ax^2 + bx + c, then return the transformed array in sorted order.",
  "constraints": [
    "1 <= len(nums) <= 200. nums is sorted in nondecreasing order.",
    "-100 <= nums[i], a, b, c <= 100. Return sorted values of a*x*x+b*x+c, preserving all occurrences."
  ],
